        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjVUbjLYjhdGUuBxW1mpv7mUVfhpqD9HB6D4Y2ZvLrLcgt3VeiW5=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "5 months ago",
        "text": "I needed a solution for stabilizers on the front of my RV trailer and Lloyd came to the rescue. He designed a great system that allows stabilizing the front of the trailer and stowing the posts when not needed. He went the extra mile to make a fit to purpose solution. Great service. Great ideas. Great price.",
        "time": 1756147647,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "David Robbins",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/115957228115499503140/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a-/ALV-UjWFTbmIkyE916XUvNc4QKcl1sC8X17MRkRcb4zqDZjaMf1NA01MgA=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo-ba4",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "My wife saw a wine glass/bottle holder in a restaurant and wanted the same thing for our house. The product doesn't appear to exist anywhere so I drafted a model of it and brought it here to see if they could fabricate it.\n\nA quick chat with them on what I was looking for and shared the model and like magic, they made my custom wine rack that everyone wants when they visit!\n\nGreat service and amazing work from the guys here and will definitely be coming back to have more work done 😄",
        "time": 1712262005,
        "translated": false
      },
      {
        "author_name": "Alan Libertella",
        "author_url": "https://www.google.com/maps/contrib/105573408218348799491/reviews",
        "language": "en",
        "original_language": "en",
        "profile_photo_url": "https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/a/ACg8ocI1QUAdrQ3xmb3Zos0GdkoXnfmtDrq6lnzvNRICVNkb5OpPbg=s128-c0x00000000-cc-rp-mo",
        "rating": 5,
        "relative_time_description": "a year ago",
        "text": "Lloyd warmly welcomed me and Larry got the job done on time as agreed. You guys are in big time worthy to be recommended. Keep up the good work.. Team Rieker-Exess.!!",
        "time": 1719176322,
